---
import { getLangSwitchPath } from '../utils/getLangSwitchPath';

const currentPath = Astro.url.pathname;

const { enLink, hasEn } = await getLangSwitchPath(currentPath);
---

<!--
  Phase 4 leaf migration #1: Banner.astro
  ─────────────────────────────────────────
  - Converted to Tailwind atomic utilities in HTML
  - Removed scoped <style> block entirely
  - 2026-07-29：原本是母體的薄荷綠 (#007864 底 / #4fd1b0 連結)。這條 bar 在每一頁
    最頂端，是全站最顯眼的一塊母體顏色，所以先換：底色改品牌黑 #252126，連結改白字
    洋紅底線（跟 /about、/contribute 的連結樣式一致）。
    站上還有大量 #1a3c34 / #2d5016 母體綠散在 dark-polish.css 與各 template 裡，
    那是整套配色遷移，要一起做，不在這個檔補丁。

  2026-07-06 empty-banner bug fix (design audit §2.9-2):
  - Pages with no English version (e.g. /semiont/anatomy/, 404) rendered
    an empty green bar with only a ✕ button, because the div used to
    render unconditionally regardless of `hasEn`.
  - Fix: gate the banner div behind `hasEn` so it's absent from the DOM
    when there's no English version to switch to. The activation script
    stays top-level (it already no-ops when #lang-banner is absent:
    `var b = ...; if (b) ...`), and Header.astro's offset script also
    null-checks `getElementById('lang-banner')`, so its absence is safe.
-->{
  hasEn && (
    <div
      id="lang-banner"
      class="relative z-50 hidden items-center justify-center gap-4 bg-[#252126] px-4 py-[0.6rem] text-center text-[0.85rem] leading-snug text-white [&_a]:font-semibold [&_a]:text-white [&_a]:underline [&_a]:decoration-[#E4007E] [&_a]:decoration-2 [&_a]:underline-offset-4 [&_a:hover]:text-[#E4007E]"
    >
      <span>
        🌐 English version available → <a href={enLink}>Switch to English</a>
      </span>
      <button
        class="cursor-pointer border-none bg-transparent px-[0.3rem] text-base text-white/70 hover:text-white"
        onclick="document.getElementById('lang-banner').style.display='none';localStorage.setItem('lang-banner-dismissed','1');var h=document.getElementById('main-header');if(h)h.style.top='0px';document.documentElement.style.scrollPaddingTop='';"
        aria-label="Close"
      >
        ✕
      </button>
    </div>
  )
}
<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    if (localStorage.getItem('lang-banner-dismissed')) return;
    var lang = navigator.language || navigator.userLanguage || '';
    if (lang.startsWith('zh')) return;
    if (window.location.pathname.startsWith('/en')) return;
    var b = document.getElementById('lang-banner');
    if (b) b.style.display = 'flex';
  })();
</script>
